# The built-in theme under internal/app/theme/ and the agent skill under
# internal/app/skill/ are built into the program, and the golden files under
# internal/app/testdata/ are compared byte for byte with the page it gives,
# which has \n line endings on every platform. Windows git checks out CRLF by
# default, which would put \r into a program built from a Windows checkout and
# fail those tests and TestSkillNoCR on the windows runner, for a difference
# that is not in the repository, so pin the working tree to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
